# Security: COPY . . copies the entire build context recursively (docker:
# S6470) -- anything a developer happens to have sitting locally at build
# time (not just what's tracked by git) gets baked permanently into an
# image layer otherwise. cookies.txt in particular was previously found
# committed to this repo's history (a real leaked secret); excluding it
# here stops a local copy from being re-baked into an image even after
# that history was purged.
cookies.txt
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*credentials*
*secret*



